# DOWN.SCR - the last INVTEST run of srvgate.sh, against INVSERV started
# again on the same data: the change INV /CMD made is still there, and
# once ADMIN SHUTDOWN has been answered another session's request is
# refused with 501.

@CALL 1 RIADMIN
> HELLO RIADMIN
< +OK
> LOGIN ADMIN Srv2gate
< +OK LEVEL=3 NAME="System Administrator"
> ITEM LIST CAT=DRV
< +DATA
< F ITEM_ID CATEGORY MFR MODEL WORKS QTY AVAIL LOC_ID LOC_NAME STATUS
< R 25 DRV Tandon TM100-2 ? 2 Y 0 "" A
< .
@CALL 2 RIREAD
> HELLO RIREAD
< +OK
@S 1
> ADMIN SHUTDOWN
< +OK
@S 2
> PING
< -ERR 501 server shutting down
